{"kind": "mod", "id": 1265, "name": "Rai's Hidden Caches", "slug": "rais-hidden-caches", "teaser": "Adds a flare-like effect to all of the hidden stashes on the map! Smoke, lighting, and audio will emit from all the random secret caches to help you find them! Effects can be customized and toggled.", "owner_name": "RaiRaiTheRaichu", "downloads": 102350, "favourites": 59, "featured": false, "contains_ads": true, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "University of Illinois/NCSA Open Source License", "guid": "com.rairai.hiddencaches.eft", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:15:43.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-04-01T23:34:02.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-04-01T23:34:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.0", "latest_version": "1.3.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/ncsa/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Mod Info</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Rai’s Hidden Caches</strong></p>\n<p>Want to support my work? Consider clicking the link below!</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/rairaitheraichu\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"kofi2.png?v=3\" /></a></p>\n<p>An SPT Bepinex client mod that adds a flare-like smoke, light, and sound effect to all of the random hidden caches located around the map, making them easily visible.</p>\n<p>This mod features some customization options, such as enabling or disabling each of the three effects, as well as letting you customize the color of the smoke and lighting effect.</p>\n<p><strong>How to install</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Simply extract the zip file contents into your root SPT-AKI folder (where EscapeFromTarkov.exe is).</li>\n<li>Your BepInEx/plugins folder should now contain a RaiRai.HiddenCaches.dll file inside.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>License</strong></p>\n<p>Do not reupload or redistribute anywhere <em>without explicit permission</em>.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>RaiRaiTheRaichu</p>\n<p>Special thanks to:</p>\n<p>Terkoiz</p>\n<p>DrakiaXYZ</p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 23394, "published_at": "2024-04-01T23:34:02.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1265/rais-hidden-caches/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 30440, "published_at": "2024-07-13T19:51:11.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1265/rais-hidden-caches/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 17871, "published_at": "2024-12-21T05:59:55.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1265/rais-hidden-caches/1.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 25224, "published_at": "2025-03-28T21:09:36.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1265/rais-hidden-caches/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 8098, "downloads": 5421, "published_at": "2026-06-15T01:37:00.000000Z", "fo